      aud: { role: "全入出力・ツール実行の証跡。", tech: "改ざん耐性ログ、トレースID貫通。", biz: "インシデント時に「何が起きたか5分で言える」体制が信頼を守る。", qa: "ログ自体の機密性は？（→ログにPIIが残る問題。マスキングと保持期限）", cost: "保存は安いが無限に増える。階層化ストレージで制御。", roleEn: "A trail of all I/O and tool executions.", techEn: "Trace-ID propagation, tamper resistance, retention limits.", bizEn: "'Explain what happened in 5 minutes' is what protects trust.", qaEn: "Is the log itself confidential? (→ PII may sit in logs; mask and set retention)", costEn: "Audit logging is cheap insurance; it's the incident-response lifeline." },
